descriptions.description:
A dataset containing 4665086 species occurrences available in GBIF matching the query:
{
 "and" : [
 "TaxonKey is Arthropoda",
 "GadmGid is USA.5_1",
 "HasGeospatialIssue is false"
 ]
}

 The dataset includes 4665086 records from 483 constituent datasets; see https://api.gbif.org/v1/occurrence/download/0010070-260921141020460/datasets/export for details.

Data from some individual datasets included in this download may be licensed under less restrictive terms.
